# Coldline
# File: .gitattributes
# Component: Git text policy
# Purpose: Keep text line endings stable across Windows and Linux. Text files check out with
#          LF everywhere, so a checkout never changes the bytes Docker copies into an image.
# Interacts With: Git checkout, CI and the release image build context
# Sprint/Task: Sprint 5 — Project 5 / starter (Task 5.1)
# Concepts: Cross-platform reproducibility, reproducible builds
# Tools: Git

* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mako text eol=lf
